Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
The official C implementation of the BLAKE3 hash function. Used by
//components/pubky_session to derive Pubky relay channel IDs.

Local Modifications:
Only the portable implementation is included: blake3.h, blake3.c,
blake3_impl.h, blake3_portable.c and blake3_dispatch.c from c/. SIMD back ends
are disabled with BLAKE3_NO_* defines in BUILD.gn. The project is also offered
under CC0-1.0 and Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception (LICENSE_CC0, LICENSE_A2LLVM).
